{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eHSb1VIItMHzV2BxUfpU9Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:32.650776+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eHSb1VIItMHzV2BxUfpU9Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8icWQMiasAWbdNVxs5icR2eCuGZ7XwpfgVWzElhzzghMYrjZF9Ix0qm0f5vBOufFribUGcsM3f9ydqQzLYAlJ39qeA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的交流，增进学生对兰州大学外国语学院的了解，帮助学生接触外国语言文学学科发展前沿，培养学生对外国语言文学的学习和研究兴趣，我院将举办“兰州大学外国语学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”。现将相关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2026年7月2日至3日</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动人数</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>25人左右</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.对外国语言文学及相关学科有浓厚的兴趣，具备较强的专业理论基础和良好的科研潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请者为英语、俄语专业的</span><strong><span>大三年级本科生</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.学习成绩优秀，在校前五个学期成绩排名专业前20％；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.专业四级成绩达70分以上。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.夏令营申请表1份，须有所在学院公章（附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.两位副教授及其以上职称的专家亲笔签名推荐信（附件2）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.大学学习成绩单原件，须加盖申请者本人所在学院或学校教务部门的学习成绩专用章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.英语水平证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.在读证明或学生证扫描件（学生扫描件需带本人照片页与注册页）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.其他证明材料：本科阶段获奖证书复印件或体现自身学习能力的代表性成果等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>以上申请材料电子版按顺序合并为一个PDF文档，以“夏令营+所在学校+姓名”命名，于2026年6月22日12:00前发送至邮箱</span></span><span><span>helx@lzu.edu.cn，</span></span><span><span>同时打开以下网址填写兰州大学外国语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营报名表，表格内容已加密，不涉及个人隐私泄露。</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://www.kdocs.cn/l/cdft2jXUzCpz</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：以上申请材料须确保真实有效，因信息填写错误、填报虚假信息造成的后果由申请者本人承担。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>材料审核与营员确定</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学院将组织专家逐一审核评估申请者提供的各项材料，择优确定夏令营营员名单并报兰州大学研究生院审核，经审核通过的夏令营营员名单于6月26日之前在兰州大学外国语学院官方网站（http://wyy.lzu.edu.cn/）公布，并以邮件形式通知本人，未被接收为营员者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人通过营员资格审核后，入营报到时提交夏令营申请表、成绩单原件以及上述所需提交的电子材料纸质版。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：网上申请、电子材料、纸质材料提交缺一不可。材料须真实有效，因信息填写错误、填报虚假信息造成的后果由申请人本人承担。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibXthVwNluUibRPWlgkfjdmusv7askN98YpgDYSuibQW0Xwp27pSSPugKP1CKLrmsle8sT23RCia5pt6f8iceALxRa3HjebialWG9nhRPsvkdmEcQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>注：以上安排为暂定日程，如有变化将及时通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.夏令营期间学院将为营员提供住宿（包含1晚，双人标间，原则上双人入住，本校学生不提供住宿）、购买人身保险、报销异地学校学生往返交通费（火车硬座、高铁二等座、汽车）。请自行提前预订往返车票，主办方不提供订票服务。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.营员必须遵守2026年兰州大学外国语学院优秀大学生夏令营相关规定和纪律，服从工作人员安排，并按时参加夏令营期间的各项活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.营员报名后请规划好时间安排，被录取后无特殊情况不得随意放弃。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.未尽事宜，请拨打电话咨询。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.单位名称：兰州大学外国语学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.联系人：何老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.联系电话：0931-8912663/5292273</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.电子邮箱：helx@lzu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>兰州大学外国语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营期待你的到来！</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eHSb1VIItMHzV2BxUfpU9Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：兰州大学外国语学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营报名表.doc</a> </span></p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eHSb1VIItMHzV2BxUfpU9Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：专家推荐信.doc</a> </span><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span> 外国语学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年6月2日</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>衔华佩实 · 博学明德</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cWmibahicaXeRcbnN55OGWBnrIDTLZwhnv5aUVUJ9f7iar0rWZYX7pG16Zsru7hJ79k7XLzqXXWPV0O4EAV31qXWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><